+Description:
+                Read-only exact-Uke diagnostic snapshot. Version 1 contains:
+                version generation firmware_generation source_event_generation
+                service_up desynced suspended removing linux_errno raw_result
+                last_reply_receipt_boottime_ns driver_instance_boottime_ns
+
+                All fields are decimal, space separated, terminated by newline.
+                Generations wrap modulo 2^32. Equality is useful only within one
+                driver instance and bounded observation interval. A collector
+                must also identify the provider, kernel/boot and instance.
+                source_event_generation counts USB property notifications and
+                service changes; it is not an atomic firmware attach ID or a
+                PD contract identifier. The final timestamp records receipt of
+                a matching reply, including error replies; it is not a sensor
+                measurement timestamp or the age of every cached property.
+
+                desynced blocks requests after an ambiguous send, timeout,
+                malformed matching reply or interrupted request. PDR up and
+                resume do not clear it. Reset requires a proven clean transport
+                boundary; live module reload is not an accepted recovery path.
+                No physical charge interruption is implied by an error flag.
